  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Lán來講看māi - 台語字母應該ài有家己ê名"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">台語字母應該ài有家己ê名</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span>江宥呈&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGnp3w-quowCyT_tjU0_JnCkmjWBlAOgPdnjntDnJqpeTr3qtOod4wBKmic889pLIhudGYuPLSMrtge19kdcN90jkqazncK44cC0AbvHUmZQZPzne_z9R5Mf_UMQv3LRyU7dmCZ_-F5_j_rl48aNSvxq1X4WDF1OHvu6Tj3E7sdTJj2azR_-Rcsk6BvxZh\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEif9zb6ACZ9y7GVgRw2Z3iyBtygmRK5OZFrXzBmW0deGwp3o9A45e3Kede7ZkBpCHU0oudq54b1BOWq8VEOVCHkHNNn-LVUDrMKIH9JqYXZ_sLvwVjRv_1EwZpeIZ-ws7AsS-Db5IdCVJE6htvjZ91nakoBpqCMHXtKrFYO5M4NQ6nrTaN5uix0lOg3IcRt\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEif9zb6ACZ9y7GVgRw2Z3iyBtygmRK5OZFrXzBmW0deGwp3o9A45e3Kede7ZkBpCHU0oudq54b1BOWq8VEOVCHkHNNn-LVUDrMKIH9JqYXZ_sLvwVjRv_1EwZpeIZ-ws7AsS-Db5IdCVJE6htvjZ91nakoBpqCMHXtKrFYO5M4NQ6nrTaN5uix0lOg3IcRt\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg-vOI2C-rbZQwXCpiClACGjMD4-SKS9BRzXw4pjP_HKZRAAbNKsHhwtzE546u-Xna-F6bAy3yuYSpqwYUoy7BP7WYqqrcBu6awzEI0EZeyTQKyrZOtv6bvdZPx-QJKqtbBGo_b6KuK3T0Tepwmj4Nq9KB0l3ZpXpcxUvqzUdWWpoaWCAx3vkL7lTTOj_kg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg-vOI2C-rbZQwXCpiClACGjMD4-SKS9BRzXw4pjP_HKZRAAbNKsHhwtzE546u-Xna-F6bAy3yuYSpqwYUoy7BP7WYqqrcBu6awzEI0EZeyTQKyrZOtv6bvdZPx-QJKqtbBGo_b6KuK3T0Tepwmj4Nq9KB0l3ZpXpcxUvqzUdWWpoaWCAx3vkL7lTTOj_kg=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgis8StNBBz4bNmjMNTe_fN1Vp2axfmIuWxa4opF6I2qJdwZX8foSZ2bZsVKTJC5WeHhcOnGsq_KJo6zxlTyUtOxZTPMFVBzaKV3jICFog_heiVaAgplFq-ZCG5YUEI1yc5hMCXtfgFbZ6AQC2ZUpSDZo0quF4096-DLzvuVxQGiJunZV5eOFKXUTZhBhRL\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgis8StNBBz4bNmjMNTe_fN1Vp2axfmIuWxa4opF6I2qJdwZX8foSZ2bZsVKTJC5WeHhcOnGsq_KJo6zxlTyUtOxZTPMFVBzaKV3jICFog_heiVaAgplFq-ZCG5YUEI1yc5hMCXtfgFbZ6AQC2ZUpSDZo0quF4096-DLzvuVxQGiJunZV5eOFKXUTZhBhRL\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWcARNB1S7AKEFIj-_GnS4FC9EQhvyJaR0nvnsIlMm3fV_ucNId677TLSqkrJPnHXVmXVWQOZSxqPFwCTI6soKZGuNEhRV-1IEC-NREJ0Rczjr8oe1ypGzdad96b3lDHw6wGszNRRtuNIFFAQM4UbgVcGMbc9rpbGHQCwCc2X6CCcCfDte409PE9hI8BQA\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWcARNB1S7AKEFIj-_GnS4FC9EQhvyJaR0nvnsIlMm3fV_ucNId677TLSqkrJPnHXVmXVWQOZSxqPFwCTI6soKZGuNEhRV-1IEC-NREJ0Rczjr8oe1ypGzdad96b3lDHw6wGszNRRtuNIFFAQM4UbgVcGMbc9rpbGHQCwCc2X6CCcCfDte409PE9hI8BQA=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiv_lZse-mhyRWDJ3nNEKmtTFxajfNxxkTafAWGuOMFwsV28SKOaQZV9SK2vnuunHEVJNPIhkP4X_PpXkr7SBg9-6dRxy97BBHzyv5HuPLiOe4QI9Ik9LMWY3_y9m-7PbypjJ8uHFarakYUK9LnFWCdxCVpxmcXiq1P4bvQTNV_fLfEpEJcH57uB-uKL4sv\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiv_lZse-mhyRWDJ3nNEKmtTFxajfNxxkTafAWGuOMFwsV28SKOaQZV9SK2vnuunHEVJNPIhkP4X_PpXkr7SBg9-6dRxy97BBHzyv5HuPLiOe4QI9Ik9LMWY3_y9m-7PbypjJ8uHFarakYUK9LnFWCdxCVpxmcXiq1P4bvQTNV_fLfEpEJcH57uB-uKL4sv=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ95MJtVjlzeOrZc0e3TySfNW1GiRt51rUhwtf961uDG7OL8P6cfiPDsOIesNX5HoYI9daLHuPS-KOdjOPuQl5bMBuDdOmKvJw5N9YFbhwTXaAkc8-pL999aolZqvlZZ4JmSHf72D11COBtkXhx9IXUPVXbnxHphW751RJHDvi-uL88AB4hODwbEVbtTpY\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ95MJtVjlzeOrZc0e3TySfNW1GiRt51rUhwtf961uDG7OL8P6cfiPDsOIesNX5HoYI9daLHuPS-KOdjOPuQl5bMBuDdOmKvJw5N9YFbhwTXaAkc8-pL999aolZqvlZZ4JmSHf72D11COBtkXhx9IXUPVXbnxHphW751RJHDvi-uL88AB4hODwbEVbtTpY=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></span></div></div></span></div></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</span>Lán人leh指稱台羅拼音iah是白話字ê字母，tshiâng-tsāi去用英語ê字母名來稱呼，像講「a、b、c」就呼「/eɪ/、/bi/、/si/」，án-ne落--去（用「//」giap--起-來ê符號lóng是國際音標〈International Phonetic Alphabet，IPA〉，若m̄ bat ê朋友ē-sái暫時kā當做是KK音標iah是台羅）。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp;</span>不而過，lán若去看別種語言有採用拉丁字母--者，lóng有in家己稱呼字母ê方式。歐洲語言像德語、法語就免講，就算是khah近代tsiah採用拉丁字母ê語言，親像越南語、甚至是中國ê漢語拼音lóng是kōo家己ê名leh稱呼拉丁字母，m̄是「/eɪ/、/bi/、/si/」án-ne leh叫。比論講漢語拼音kā「a」唸做ㄚ、「o」唸做ㄛ、「e」唸做ㄜ、「i」唸做一、「u」唸做ㄨ等等--ê。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne有啥mih好--處？</span></h4><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span>若是對台語ê字母有熟sāi，就ē知影講英語kah台語ê發音有bē少無仝，譬論講喙平平唸「伊」ê發音，tī英語是「e」tsit个字母，tī台語suah是「i」ê發音；iah是講英語ê「b」孤仔一个唸--起-來khah成台語ê「pi」、英語ê「p」tī台語唸--起-來khah成「phi」。Án-ne m̄-nā ē造成lán溝通ê困擾，leh說明一个字按怎拼ê時tsūn講bē伸tshia，久--來koh ē去影響著lán對台語音ê直覺。親像講著台語「p」ê音，可能就ē想著英語ê「b」，tsua̋nn寫tîng-tânn--去。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span>顛倒講，若是教學ê時tsūn，台語字母有一套家己ê唸法，學生應該就khah bē kā發音絞絞做伙，舞kah花--去，hōo學生koh-khah快bat台語羅馬字。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ7iEvDjdRtIoP7c5Way8n0r-e6Ksm56fAd6mMfic25Fez8tRsR7F8by1pj6JELkcgUymt_EvebbEQeZWPSCW0ARmr0SnTgERiELPUmXBdcQSPIYiOLPk0wMW_8MbGtr9ejZCDzn0Xt0vrnH6Hu_2VOrjddnPb44QYwXo5NEzgyp60_rBDKtKqZ4awKS0m\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"471\" data-original-width=\"1023\" height=\"147\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ7iEvDjdRtIoP7c5Way8n0r-e6Ksm56fAd6mMfic25Fez8tRsR7F8by1pj6JELkcgUymt_EvebbEQeZWPSCW0ARmr0SnTgERiELPUmXBdcQSPIYiOLPk0wMW_8MbGtr9ejZCDzn0Xt0vrnH6Hu_2VOrjddnPb44QYwXo5NEzgyp60_rBDKtKqZ4awKS0m\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><div><h4><b>Ài按怎叫？</b></h4><div><b><br /></b></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><span><div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span>若無愛按英語ê名稱來叫，tio̍h按怎稱呼逐个字母？若講著tse，lán tio̍h-ài kā字母分組討論--ah，tsia以台羅拼音做例：</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">[母音]</span></b></div><div><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span>台語lóng總有6个母音，「a、i、u、e、o、oo」，tsit部份khah單純，直接用in ê發音來當做名就好。</span></div></div></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>[子音]</b></span></div><div style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span>子音ē-tàng koh分幾組。</span></div></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkw6vSiKoO-qFkm4HAGXCbHPvYdk2HPFWzBn-gRYyMFJ_5dAwjKsCgKk1-mvIXH5luQi4bd_havreqPE7zP3cU2n3hXyN64088s__tQUeQfXIWHD2x6sLo8q17D0FOphlIC3sYSn33RO16wwyClP_zhOVUrNFvf7vnFF8S_kLBQ2hx14eJDXKAc98hobpc\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"511\" data-original-width=\"1128\" height=\"145\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkw6vSiKoO-qFkm4HAGXCbHPvYdk2HPFWzBn-gRYyMFJ_5dAwjKsCgKk1-mvIXH5luQi4bd_havreqPE7zP3cU2n3hXyN64088s__tQUeQfXIWHD2x6sLo8q17D0FOphlIC3sYSn33RO16wwyClP_zhOVUrNFvf7vnFF8S_kLBQ2hx14eJDXKAc98hobpc\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">（舌尾〈tsi̍h-bué〉華語號做『舌尖』；舌頭〈tsi̍h-thâu〉iah是舌根〈tsi̍h-kin〉華語號做『舌根』）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">&nbsp;1 編註：「h」tsit个音tī《臺灣台語羅馬字拼音方案使用手冊》內底是歸做「喉音」。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">&nbsp;2編註：Tsit組音tī《臺灣台語羅馬字拼音方案使用手冊》內底kā號做「齒音」iah「舌齒音」。</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>若是參考教育部「羅馬字拼音教學網」示範ê發音，前三tsuā ē-sái tī子音後壁鬥「or」（注音符號ê ㄜ），念做「por、phor、mor、bor」等等--ê。若準你ê腔口無「or」ê母音，kā唸做 「po、pho、mo、bo」mā ē-tàng。第四tsuā後壁鬥「ir」（注音符號ㄗㄘㄙ ê母音）念做「tsir、tshir、sir、jir」。注意，tī tsia親像「ph」án-ne，兩个字母表示一个音ê「二合字母（jī-ha̍p-jī-bó）」，無應該唸做「po、ho」，ài看做一个單位，唸做「pho」，若無，仝款ē拄著頭前講--ê，字母名kah音無sio-thīn ê問題。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><div><h4>按怎拼音</h4><div><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><span><div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;孤唸ê唸法解決--ah，suà--落-來ài按怎kā in鬥--起-來--leh？若是照lán拼英語ê拼法，隨个kā字母名唸--出-來，像講「siám，sir i a mor，第二調，siám」，hit个韻律感聽--起-來kánn-ná怪怪？我自底mā lóng án-ne想，一直想無到底按怎唸tsiah ē通。一直到看著tsit支影片〈HOW TO SPELL IN VIETNAMESE〉示範越南語按怎拼音，tsiah雄雄開竅！Lán thang好kā一个字分做三句，先拼韻母，suà--落-來講聲母+韻母，上尾tsiah添聲調。Lán看兩个例：</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>[</b><b>siám</b><b>]</b></span></div><div style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">i a mor, iam →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">sir iam siam →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">第二調，siám</span></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>[lîng]</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">i ngor, ing →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">lor ing, ling →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">第五調，lîng</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div></div></div></span></span></span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>當然，拄著子音+單／雙母音ê結構，lán uân-nā ē-sái唸hōo khah束結--leh，可比講：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>[guá]</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">gor u a，第二調，guá</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>上尾，koh有鼻音「nn」iáu未講--著。Tsit个音ài按怎唸--leh？我ê想法是，直接講「鼻音」iah是唸做「no no」lóng ē用得。譬論講：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>[penn]</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">e nor nor, enn →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">p enn, penn →</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">第一調，penn</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">第一tsuā mā ē-tàng換做</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">e 鼻音，enn</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>講到tsia，lán就ē-tàng完全用台語ê字母名來拼寫台語--looh。若beh靠英語字母名拼寫台語，講規半晡可能iáu hut bē清楚；照頂面所講，用台語ê字母名來唸，逐个音lóng分kah明明明，ē-tàng講是ke tsiânn利便--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（本文uì網誌「雞仔囝起豹飆」轉載，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：https://keakiann.org/2024/11/17/ji-bo-mia/）</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, 